                <h1 class="font-serif text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-normal text-stone-900 dark:text-stone-100">
                    19th-Century Eastern Woodlands Kinship & Legal Geographies
                </h1>
                <p class="text-stone-600 dark:text-stone-400 text-sm max-w-3xl leading-relaxed">
                    An archival timeline analyzing petitions, land records, and legal petitions submitted by Black and Indigenous communities across the Eastern Woodlands between 1810 and 1890.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Controls & Filters -->
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4 justify-between items-center bg-white dark:bg-stone-900 p-4 rounded-xl border border-warmbg-200 dark:border-stone-800">
